# Force 301 redirects from .html URLs to extensionless canonical form.
# The trailing "!" force flag overrides Netlify's default "static file wins" behavior,
# so the redirect applies even though cost.html / rebates.html / permits.html exist on disk.
# Source: https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/#shadowing

/index.html    /         301!
/cost.html     /cost     301!
/rebates.html  /rebates  301!
/permits.html  /permits  301!
